# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only what the image needs.
**

# Go sources (no tests).
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Go module files.
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Vendored Harbor chart tarballs — copied into the runtime image at /charts/
# so the helm runner can load them offline (no network at reconcile time).
# See charts/README.md.
!charts/
!charts/**
